# glidescale — GLIDE_CONSTANT, one pass of the phrase (~9s). The A side.
# Every slide takes the same 300ms whatever the interval, so the semitone steps
# crawl and the 22-semitone leap is a blur. Nothing to press: the phrase autoplays.
#   node tools/play.js glidescale script tools/clips/glidescale/01-constant.script \
#        --headless --frames 545 --wav /tmp/const.wav
# frames 545
